Rita: Alex used to spend a lot of time with the scientist, in his lab
Rita: They were close, always working on something together
Rita: But his office exploded a while ago..she was keeping some dangerous chemicals there.
Rita: He's been missing ever since, hiding from everyone
- What happened to her?
	Rita: I don't know exactly, he doesn't really talk to much people here
